"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T00:10:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T00:11:28Z","body":"Hi,\n\nThank you for your interest in our work! We used the same evaluation protocols as the \"Look Outside the Room\"[1] and \"PhotoNVS\"[2].  \nWe also described the evaluation details in the paper. \n\nThanks!\n\n\n[1] Ren, Xuanchi, and Xiaolong Wang. \"Look outside the room: Synthesizing a consistent long-term 3d scene video from a single image.\" Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition. 2022.\n[2] Yu, Jason J., et al. \"Long-term photometric consistent novel view synthesis with diffusion models.\" Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision. 2023.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3071389658/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3071392338","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/4#issuecomment-3071392338","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/4","id":3071392338,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs63EbpS","user":{"login":"runjiali-rl","id":81925824,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTI1ODI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81925824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T00:12:52Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T00:12:52Z","body":"Hi,\n\nThank you for your interest in our work! I would love to keep the huggingface demo open but we are running out of budget supporting it. I would love to run some samples for you if you don't have the compute.\n\nThanks!","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3071392338/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3071401322","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/1#issuecomment-3071401322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/1","id":3071401322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs63Ed1q","user":{"login":"runjiali-rl","id":81925824,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTI1ODI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81925824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T00:18:28Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T00:18:28Z","body":"Hi,\n\nThank you for the reminder! \nI just added a license.\n\nThanks!","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3071401322/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3118559456","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/4#issuecomment-3118559456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/4","id":3118559456,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs654XDg","user":{"login":"marquismiller","id":90892903,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODkyOTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90892903?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller","html_url":"https://github.com/marquismiller","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marquismiller/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T15:21:20Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T15:21:20Z","body":"Sorry wrong account [deleted prior reply. Wrote:]\nMy apologies for the inconvenience! I really respect what you have going here and hope I wasn't a bother lol.\n\nI really do appreciate that!!\n\nI was thinking. Could this run on Google Collab? Maybe we can use our drive and the free GPU Google has to make it possible? I'm not entirely aware in this space. If possible, may we have a video tutorial to test this beauty on Collab? That way it doesn't break budget and people can have an immediate test run on what this masterpiece has the true capabilities of fulfilling?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3118559456/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3513105032","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/5#issuecomment-3513105032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/5","id":3513105032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs7RZbqI","user":{"login":"XinyaChen21","id":107308495,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmVlzw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107308495?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21","html_url":"https://github.com/XinyaChen21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XinyaChen21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T17:41:10Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T17:41:10Z","body":"Hi, did you test the whole sequences longer than 200 frames, or test 200 sampled sequences longer than 200 frames (like \"Look Outside the Room\")? If it’s the latter case, would you mind sharing the test split you used?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3513105032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3538424939","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/10#issuecomment-3538424939","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/10","id":3538424939,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs7S6BRr","user":{"login":"runjiali-rl","id":81925824,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTI1ODI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81925824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T08:51:30Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T08:51:30Z","body":"Hi,\n\nThank you for asking!\n\nSo for generation, we use a 10 frame-skip, following the code from [1]\n\n[1]\n@inproceedings{ren2022look,\n  title={Look Outside the Room: Synthesizing A Consistent Long-Term 3D Scene Video from A Single Image},\n  author={Ren, Xuanchi and Wang, Xiaolong},\n  booktitle = {Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR)},\n  year={2022}\n}","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3538424939/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3538425610","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/5#issuecomment-3538425610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/5","id":3538425610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs7S6BcK","user":{"login":"runjiali-rl","id":81925824,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTI1ODI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81925824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T08:52:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T08:52:37Z","body":"Hi XInya,\n\nWe tested all samples with longer than 200 frames.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3538425610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3538426795","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/8#issuecomment-3538426795","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/8","id":3538426795,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs7S6Bur","user":{"login":"runjiali-rl","id":81925824,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTI1ODI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81925824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T08:54:21Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T08:54:21Z","body":"We also observe that under different noise initialization the model might generate trajectories, I am suspecting it is because the model was pretrained on scale invariant datasets, I would suggest play around with the translating scaling factors to get the correct results","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3538426795/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3538427776","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/9#issuecomment-3538427776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/9","id":3538427776,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs7S6B-A","user":{"login":"runjiali-rl","id":81925824,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTI1ODI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81925824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runjiali-rl/subscriptions","organizations_u