congHong","id":33921340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTIxMzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33921340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong","html_url":"https://github.com/YicongHong","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YicongHong/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T09:08:13Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T09:08:13Z","body":"Hi! You may need to select an image from the generated frame list at the bottom each time before clicking the next action.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3584845957/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3584880884","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/13#issuecomment-3584880884","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/13","id":3584880884,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs7VrPD0","user":{"login":"ella-collins","id":57517839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTE3ODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57517839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins","html_url":"https://github.com/ella-collins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ella-collins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T09:17:47Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T09:27:53Z","body":"> Hi! You may need to select an image from the generated frame list at the bottom each time before clicking the next action.\n\nThanks for your kindly reply. Actually， when i debug this error, i find that `far_z = 1000.0  # Far plane distanc  ` far_z is too small. I change `far_z = 10000.0 `, then the code can run. Before i change, the output is  \n```Image size: 512x288\nPose R shape: (3, 3), t: [ 0.   0.  -0.1]\nSurfel positions range - x: [-3694.000, 2646.000]\nSurfel positions range - y: [-1872.250, 3089.500]\nSurfel positions range - z: [-8292.000, -2061.000]\nCamera space z range: [1964.050, 8392.998]\nProcessed 0 visible surfels\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3584880884/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3822234355","html_url":"https://github.com/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/8#issuecomment-3822234355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/8","id":3822234355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPAywhs7j0qrz","user":{"login":"Riga2","id":94682610,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaS98g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94682610?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2","html_url":"https://github.com/Riga2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Riga2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T07:15:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T07:15:29Z","body":"> Hi,\n> \n> I’ve been testing the camera control on the RealEstate10K dataset. However, I observed that as time progresses, the predictions gradually deviate more and more from the ground truth. I’m using the **call** method from VMemPipeline, providing OpenGL-style c2w camera poses.\n> \n> Could you help me understand what might be causing this increasing discrepancy?\n> \n> Attached is a test video — the left side shows the ground truth, and the right side shows the prediction from VMem.\n> \n> Thank you very much!\n> \n>  combined-vmem.mp4\n\nHi, I have encountered the same problem. Do you solve it? Many thanks if you could share.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3822234355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runjiali-rl/vmem/issues/comments/3903378393",